'''Snowcannon''' is a [[Godly Weapons|godly]] that was obtainable by purchasing the 30th tier in the Battle Pass for 100,000 [[Snow Tokens]] during the [[Christmas Event 2025]]. It can now only be obtained through trading as the event has ended.

== Appearance ==
Snowcannon appears as a Christmas type water gun. With a clear canister, loaded with snowballs. With a light blue and white color theme, matching with [[Snow Dagger]], the unboxable counterpart. Having a brand new custom sound, of a snowball on impact. 

== Trivia ==
* It partners with the godly knife [[Snow Dagger]], making the [[Murder Mystery 2 Wiki:Wiki-Bot/Snow Set|Snow Set]].
* It has a [[Chroma Weapons|chroma]] counterpart under the name [[Chroma Snowcannon]].
* This is the first godly to be obtained from a Christmas event tier reward.
* This, [[Harvester]], [[Icepiercer]], [[Gingerscope]], [[Raygun]], [[Chroma Raygun]], and [[Chroma Snowcannon]] are the only guns to have a unique trail and shooting sound effect.
** Additionally, this is the second [[Godly Weapons|godly]] gun to have a unique trail and shooting sound effect, the first being [[Raygun]]. 
